      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْفَخُ</span></b>  A man, (S, L, K,) and a horse, (L,)
<i>having inflated testicles:</i> (S, L, K:) <i>syn. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آدَرُ</span>.
(Mgh, in art, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ادر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, A beast of carriage
<i>having his pasterns inflated with wind:</i> see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفِخَ</span>. (L.)


